   "type": "feat",
   "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
   "system": {
    "description": {
     "value": "<p>You can spend Cursed Energy up to your CE modifier to use Reverse Cursed Technique using Agito as a point of origin. You can use 10 points of healing for every 1 cursed energy spent. On a hit with electrified wings, you can spend 1 cursed energy to deal an additional 2 damage die and cause a creature that fails its save to also gain disadvantage on Strength and Dexterity saves it makes for 1 minute. If you spend at least 3 CE this way, a creature that fails its save is paralyzed until the beginning of their next turn. A creature can repeat this save at the end of their turn.</p>",
